# The agents view: open it, step through the agents and their threads, look
# at one agent's own screen with ctrl+], and come back with ctrl+b i.
# The rows are docs, web, review and api: G goes to api, the last row.
Sleep 600ms
Press "ctrl+b i"
Sleep 1200ms
Press "G"
Sleep 2200ms
Press "k"
Sleep 1000ms
Press "k"
Sleep 1000ms
Press "j"
Sleep 900ms
Press "j"
Sleep 1500ms
Press "ctrl+]"
Sleep 2200ms
Press "ctrl+b i"
Sleep 1800ms
